name texpower
category Package
revision 29349
shortdesc Create dynamic online presentations with LaTeX
longdesc TeXPower is a bundle of packages intended to provide an
longdesc all-inclusive environment for designing pdf screen
longdesc presentations to be viewed in full-screen mode, especially for
longdesc projecting `online' with a video beamer. For some of its core
longdesc functions, it uses code derived from ppower4 packages. It is,
longdesc however, not a complete environment in itself: it relies on an
longdesc existing class for preparing slides (such as foiltex or
longdesc seminar) or another package such as pdfslide.
depend tpslifonts
